		{
			dependencies: ["47965C310D9847DC"]
			description: [
				"Well, you've finally made it to the moon, now what? "
				""
				"From research, moon sand has some interesting reactions with iron, but it might take a bit of effort to figure out how to best utilize it..."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"As you can guess, this is the GregTech Community Pack Modern copypasted, because I am not writing an entire questbook for a dumb april fools joke. Things may not be completely accurate, but it beats the built in GTM documentation, which is to say, none."
				""
				"The questbook you're reading is &ebrimming with information&r to guide you through the modpack, so check it out if you find yourself getting lost.  We wrote it with both &dold-school veterans&r and &bnewcomers&r in mind."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
